# Per-machine game/SDK paths for the justfile. Template: env.example
.env
# Local secrets: the Forgejo PAT the release script reads (tools/release.ps1). ⛔ Separate from
# .env on purpose — the justfile exports .env into every recipe's environment, the launched game's
# included. This repo is PUBLIC — a token committed here is a token leaked to everyone, so the
# ignore must land BEFORE the file ever does. Rotate at git.alex19ep.me/user/settings/applications
# if that ever happens.
/.env.rc
# The release script's parked worktree, build tree, stage and archives.
/release-stage/
# Third-party mod sources cloned for reconnaissance (LWOTC and friends). Read-only reference —
# never a build input, and never ours to commit.
/refmods/
